Article 2 (Requirements for Designation of Specialized Institutions for Synthetic Biology Policy)
The Minister of Science and ICT may designate an institution or organization that satisfies all of the following requirements as a specialized institution for synthetic biology policy pursuant to Article 13 (1) of the Synthetic Biology Promotion Act:
1. The activities of the institution or organization shall include duties relating to support for synthetic biology policy;
2. The institution or organization shall have a dedicated organizational unit and dedicated personnel capable of performing the duties specified in the subparagraphs of Article 20 (1) of the Enforcement Decree of the Synthetic Biology Promotion Act (hereinafter referred to as the "Decree");
3. The institution or organization shall have dedicated workspaces and facilities necessary to perform the duties specified in the subparagraphs of Article 20 (1) of the Decree.
